    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2022-tame-22: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.42";
    dc:description "Information diffusion and coordinated responses can be quantified. The transition from those observables to a larger Self is conceptual, so existing data resolve only the mechanistic proxy.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Trace labeled signals through gap-junction-coupled cells and test whether coupling reduces source-identification accuracy while increasing coordinated pursuit of a shared measurable setpoint relative to uncoupled controls.";
